  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;\"><sub><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.theaivalley.com/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Sign up</a></sub><sub> | </sub><sub><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://twitter.com/heyBarsee?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Follow us on X</a></sub><sub> | </sub><sub><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.theaivalley.com/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e0828192938585a0818996818c8c8599ce8189\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\" data-skip-tracking=\"true\">Sponsor</a></sub></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.theaivalley.com/subscribe\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;border-radius:15px;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/c167fb98-39eb-42d4-a114-56fe02753cac/2__1_-min__2_-min.png?t=1744033912\"></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:center;\">Together with</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <a href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main8?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/9516e397-cc32-4fa9-b02a-109e60719cd5/viktor_logo_top__5_.png?t=1787667366\"></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;padding:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">howdy, it’s Barsee again.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">happy friday, AI family, and welcome back to AI Valley.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>here are the biggest things worth knowing today:</b></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">OpenAI’s chief scientist wants everyone to slow down</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Agency and Agents</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Tesla Robotaxi becomes the #1 travel app, surpassing Uber</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Plus trending AI tools, posts, and resources</p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Let’s <i>dive</i> into the Valley of AI…</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#222222;border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;margin:0.0px 7.0px 9.0px 7.0px;padding:10.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:Normal;font-size:15px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.125;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#00bd52;\"><b>VIKTOR</b></span></h4>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:6px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:3px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:500;font-size:26px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main8-hl?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">12 internal web apps in 44 days, from Slack messages</a></h2>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;\">\n    <div style=\"padding-bottom:7px;padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:5px;\">\n     <img alt=\"\" style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/3df3a5a9-a7fb-44c9-883e-233dc714dede/aivalley_main8v3_1280x720__2___1___1_.png?t=1788791015\">\n     <div style=\"margin:0 auto 0 auto;padding:4px 0px 4px 0px;text-align:left;width:100%;\">\n      <small style=\"color:#000000;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-style:italic;text-decoration-color:#000000;text-decoration:none;\"> \n       <p>Courtesy: Viktor</p> \n      </small>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Hampton is a 25-person founders network. Its co-founder was about to hire a data engineer at $200K, with an ops manager and a PM queued up behind that. He installed Viktor on April 12. Forty-four days later the team had 12 web apps live and 26 scheduled tasks running on their own. None of those hires are on the calendar.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Viktor is an AI employee that works in Slack and Microsoft Teams. Describe the tool you need in a message and it builds a real web app, with logins and a database, deployed at a live link. Then it keeps working. It connects to 3,200+ tools and runs the recurring work around the app, so the numbers are fresh when you open it.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">Hampton's VP of Core Experience: \"I don't have to create from scratch anymore. Just edit what it creates.\" 60,000+ teams have hired one.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://ref.viktor.com/vik-aiv-main8?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Start free. Up to $100 in credits →</a></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:right;\"><sub><i>*This is sponsored</i></sub></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-color:#222222;border-radius:15px;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;margin:0.0px 7.0px 9.0px 7.0px;padding:10.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:8px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:5px;\">\n    <h4 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:Normal;font-size:15px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.125;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:#00bd52;\"><b>THROUGH THE VALLEY</b></span></h4>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"py-2\">\n    <div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto\">\n     <blockquote align=\"center\" class=\"twitter-tweet\">\n      <p dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"></p>\n      <a data-skip-tracking=\"true\" href=\"https://twitter.com/merettm/status/2096630018495377464?s=20\"> \n       <p>— (@)\n        <br></p> \n      </a>\n     </blockquote>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"><b>OpenAI’s chief scientist wants everyone to slow down</b> - Jakub Pachocki wants the industry to stop treating max-speed scaling as the default. In an essay called “<a class=\"link\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/an-alien-mind?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">An Alien Mind</a>,” he argues that today’s systems are grown more than designed: a product of huge optimization runs, not a mind anyone fully understands. That, for him, is the point. You cannot assume this kind of intelligence will inherit human principles on its own.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">He dates the shift to mid-2023, when OpenAI’s RLSlow project first showed reasoning models could keep scaling. He now thinks that pace could continue into recursive self-improvement: AI doing more of the work of building better AI. Goal-following has improved. Value alignment (honesty, integrity, “love for humanity” when no one is watching) has not. <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/hugging-face-incident-and-the-road-ahead/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">The Hugging Face incident</a> is his example.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">The awkward part is OpenAI also thinks it needs more powerful models to defend against more powerful models. Cybersecurity is the obvious example, and Pachocki says future agents could potentially bargain with, trick or even blackmail people while pursuing their own goals.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\">And then there’s the timing: <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-astra/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">GPT-6 Astra</a> just shipped with big jumps in coding, computer use, cyber and science. Pachocki says it’s better aligned than the last generation, and still not enough. His conclusion: no lab has solved alignment and monitoring well enough to keep flooring it. He wants voluntary slowdowns, mandated safety bars and eventually international coordination.</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:7.0px 2.0px 7.0px 2.0px;margin:15.0px 2.0px 0.0px 2.0px;border-top-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-color:#222222;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:4px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:27px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\">TRENDING TOOLS</h1>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:15px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#222222;border-left-width:1px;border-right-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-top-width:0px;margin:0.0px 2.0px 15.0px 2.0px;padding:2.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://github.com/Kilo-Org/kilo?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Kilo</a> - an open-source agentic engineering platform and CLI that works across roughly 500 AI models, giving developers the flexibility to choose their models instead of being locked into a single AI lab</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://talentpluto.com/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Pluto</a> - share your career story in a 10-minute conversation, and Pluto turns it into a living professional profile that recruiters and AI agents can search and trust. When a strong match appears, it makes a warm introduction</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.testingcatalog.com/gemini-immersive-view-appears-in-the-students-section/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Gemini Immersive View</a> - Gemini has launched a new Immersive View experience in the Students tab, letting users interactively explore topics ranging from dinosaurs to space and rockets</p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:12px;\">\n   <p style=\"color:#333333;color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"border-bottom-left-radius:0px;padding:7.0px 2.0px 7.0px 2.0px;margin:15.0px 2.0px 0.0px 2.0px;border-top-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-color:#222222;border-top-right-radius:15px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:4px;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;padding-top:4px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:27px;font-family:'Arial',Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\">WHAT I'M CONSUMING</h1>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background-color:transparent;border-bottom-left-radius:15px;border-bottom-right-radius:15px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#222222;border-left-width:1px;border-right-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-top-width:0px;margin:0.0px 2.0px 15.0px 2.0px;padding:2.0px 2.0px 2.0px 2.0px;\">\n   <div style=\"padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:37px;padding-right:27px;padding-top:12px;\">\n    <ul style=\"color:var(--wt-text-on-background-color) !important;font-family:'Roboto',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;list-style-type:disc;margin:0px 0px 0px 25px;padding:0;\">\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/an-alien-mind/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">An Alien Mind</a></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.oneusefulthing.org/p/agency-and-agents?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">Agency and Agents</a></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Tesla Robotaxi becomes <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/Kalshi/status/2096230217329045934?s=20&amp;utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">the #1 travel app</a>, surpassing Uber</p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">OpenAI has officially achieved their goal of <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2096632033925550444?s=20&amp;utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">automated AI research interns</a></p>\n     </li>\n     <li style=\"margin:10px 0px 0px 0px;\">\n      <p style=\"text-align:left;\">Research acceleration: <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://openai.com/index/research-acceleration-view-inside-openai/?utm_source=www.theaivalley.com&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=an-openai-slowdown\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-webkit-text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;color:#2c81e5;text-decoration:underline #2c81e5;word-break:break-word;;\">The view inside OpenAI&